# Pre-push / post-push GitHub checks

Repo: [Marfa/twitch-telegram-bot](https://github.com/Marfa/twitch-telegram-bot).

## Before every `git push`

0. **GitHub status** — https://www.githubstatus.com/ (or `/api/v2/summary.json`). If **Actions**, **Git Operations**, **API Requests**, or **Webhooks** are degraded/outage (or an unresolved incident names them) — **do not push**. See [`github-status-before-push.mdc`](github-status-before-push.mdc). Prefer HostKey/SSH hotfix for prod emergencies.

1. **Open PRs** — review and handle https://github.com/Marfa/twitch-telegram-bot/pulls  
   (`gh pr list`, review/merge/close/comment as needed; do not leave blocking open work ignored).

2. **Security alerts** — check and process all of:
   - https://github.com/Marfa/twitch-telegram-bot/security/malware
   - https://github.com/Marfa/twitch-telegram-bot/security/dependabot
   - https://github.com/Marfa/twitch-telegram-bot/security/code-scanning
   - https://github.com/Marfa/twitch-telegram-bot/security/secret-scanning  
   (`gh api` alerts; fix code, bump deps, dismiss with reason, or open fix PR).

Do not push until open PRs and security alerts are consciously handled (fixed, merged, or explicitly deferred with a note to the user).

## After every `git push`

1. Watch https://github.com/Marfa/twitch-telegram-bot/actions (`gh run list` / `gh run watch`).
2. Drive failed workflows to **green**: read failed logs, fix root cause, push follow-up, re-check until Actions succeed (or report a blocker that needs the user).
3. If deploy looks half-done (502/503, crash-loop) while Actions is still Running/queued — **do not wait for green Actions**. Check container logs on the VPS immediately and hotfix/rollback via HostKey/SSH. Details: [`github-status-before-push.mdc`](github-status-before-push.mdc) § Half-deploy.

## Commands (typical)

```bash
gh pr list --repo Marfa/twitch-telegram-bot
gh api "/repos/Marfa/twitch-telegram-bot/dependabot/alerts?state=open"
gh api "/repos/Marfa/twitch-telegram-bot/code-scanning/alerts?state=open"
gh api "/repos/Marfa/twitch-telegram-bot/secret-scanning/alerts?state=open"
gh run list --repo Marfa/twitch-telegram-bot --limit 10
gh run watch <run-id> --repo Marfa/twitch-telegram-bot
gh run view <run-id> --repo Marfa/twitch-telegram-bot --log-failed
```
